      "locator": "Appendix A, p. 82",
      "status": "RESEARCH DIRECTIONS ONLY",
      "detail": "Relative toric fiber specialness, global-to-generic-fiber height comparison and function-field descent are proposed ingredients, not proved extensions or new canonical inventory atoms."
